         <p>Transcriber's Note:</p>
         <p>The dimensions of the debugging template and the keypunch card are 7 3/8" by 3 1/4".</p>
         <p>The debugging template contains two sections on the front and three sections on the back. The back is labelled vertically along the left-hand edge: IBM J33837.</p>
         <p>The front of the keypunch card is labelled vertically along the right-hand edge: PRYOR 5081. Holes punched in the card are represented in the text by [].</p>
